{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/nesba-arada-properties-muwaileh-commercial","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":722,"crm_id":"966","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Nesba ","slug":"nesba-arada-properties-muwaileh-commercial","display_address":"Muwaileh Commercial","building_type":["apartment"],"completion_year":"2026","developer":"Arada Properties","price":939000,"display_price":"939K","lattitude":25.311595,"longitude":55.4695867,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Nesba 2 is a project by Arada, located in the Muwaileh Commercial area of Sharjah. The development offers an unrivalled combination of contemporary architecture, thoughtful design and world-class amenities. It is ideal for young professionals looking to enjoy a modern urban lifestyle, as well as growing families looking for spacious and comfortable accommodation that caters to their unique needs and preferences.</p><p>There is a wide range of <strong>1-3 bedroom</strong> apartments for sale. All apartments feature impeccable finishes, open-plan layouts and large windows that allow natural light to flood the space, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. Interiors with a perfect blend of aesthetics and functionality makes each residence a haven of paradise.</p><p>Nesba 2 offers a wide range of world-class amenities including landscaped gardens, fitness centres, children's play areas and a large swimming pool with lounge area. Residents also have direct access to Eastern Boulevard, which is home to a variety of shops, cafes and restaurants.</p><p>A distinctive feature of the complex is its unique location. Sharjah International Airport and Madar are just 5 minutes away by car, Sharjah Corniche can be reached in 15 minutes, and Dubai International Academic City and Dubai International Airport can be reached in 20 minutes.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/966/images/2024/02/13/yTiGGG0tNPJ24kF97DETh2Vm5G71lNMeEMTNRQQK.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/02/13/yTiGGG0tNPJ24kF97DETh2Vm5G71lNMeEMTNRQQK.jpg","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/966/images/2024/02/13/Dzftc0y58hvz5Z7YNe2JTi9SpyClFztf2Ge3yq7G.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/02/13/Dzftc0y58hvz5Z7YNe2JTi9SpyClFztf2Ge3yq7G.jpg","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/966/images/2024/02/13/LKCkhNSqSZyyiXeuneFiEZPmCd5e82XfcwoLywlb.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/02/13/LKCkhNSqSZyyiXeuneFiEZPmCd5e82XfcwoLywlb.jpg","__ggfxIndex":2}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":2631,"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/2024/02/13/Kir0ukzE2l4Gxjpi92dctZW7rr6NWUyffT3vRJlI.pdf","file":null,"item":[],"image":null},"video_module":{"id":829,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[{"id":1365,"url":null,"area":null,"size":"1,066 ft²","media":null,"title":"1 Bedroom","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":1366,"url":null,"area":null,"size":"1,394 ft²","media":null,"title":"2 Bedroom","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":1367,"url":null,"area":null,"size":"2,559 ft²","media":null,"title":"3 Bedroom","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null}],"payment_plan_text":"45/55","payment_plans":[{"id":4019,"title":"5%","description":"On Booking"},{"id":4027,"title":"40%","description":"During Construction"},{"id":4028,"title":"55%","description":"On Handover"}],"community":"","publish":1,"currency":"","amenities":[{"id":6690,"url":null,"text":"Laundry","type":null